WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lunar approach: public products and mission events share one clock.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Pericynthion: derived Moon-center distance is distinct from altitude.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Return corrections: mission context changes with the selected moment.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Splashdown: finish the public mission record without inventing private telemetry.
